      "6 knob(s) are 14-bit, 0 - 16383: the MSB and the LSB the table prints, sent in that order: VCO 1 Frequency (CC 4, LSB 36); VCO 2 Frequency (CC 12, LSB 44); VCF (EG) ATTACK (CC 23, LSB 55); VCF (EG) DECAY (CC 24, LSB 56); VCA (EG) ATTACK (CC 28, LSB 60); VCA (EG) DECAY (CC 29, LSB 61)."
